Dooms all enemies within a radius 2 ball for 20 turns. Each time an affected target uses a talent, it takes [59, 79, 95, 108, 120 (TL1-5; SP 100)] physical damage as its life is drawn out. In addition, any bleed applied to the target will have its power increased by [15%, 26%, 35%, 43%, 50% (TL1-5)].

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.

The chance to apply will increase with your Spellpower.
